{"parse": {"title": "FT-05", "pageid": 55357, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/FT-04\" title=\"FT-04\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">FT-05</span><a href=\"/wiki/FT-06\" title=\"FT-06\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">FT</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">05</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E5.AE.A1.E8.AE.AF.E8.8A.82.E7.9B.AE\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"审讯节目\">审讯节目</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 审讯节目</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">\"Interrogation\"</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span class=\"color-value\"></span>答<span class=\"color-value\"></span>案<span class=\"color-value\"></span>当<span class=\"color-value\"></span>然<span class=\"color-value\"></span>不<span class=\"color-value\"></span>会<span class=\"color-value\"></span>写<span class=\"color-value\"></span>在<span class=\"color-value\"></span>纸<span class=\"color-value\"></span>面<span class=\"color-value\"></span>上<span class=\"color-value\"></span>。<span class=\"color-value\"></span></div><div class=\"grey-small hide-m\" style=\"float:right;\">ID: 2010105</div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_0_bg_huanzhuangshuixingfangjian.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_0_bg_huanzhuangshuixingfangjian\"><img alt=\"2_0_bg_huanzhuangshuixingfangjian\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2c/Cg-2_0_bg_huanzhuangshuixingfangjian.png/600px-Cg-2_0_bg_huanzhuangshuixingfangjian.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2c/Cg-2_0_bg_huanzhuangshuixingfangjian.png/900px-Cg-2_0_bg_huanzhuangshuixingfangjian.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2c/Cg-2_0_bg_huanzhuangshuixingfangjian.png/1200px-Cg-2_0_bg_huanzhuangshuixingfangjian.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>“哐当——”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309414.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/32/HeadIconSmall-309414.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309414.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309414.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/32/HeadIconSmall-309414.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309414.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/32/HeadIconSmall-309414.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309414.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">J：</div><div>呃……！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他单膝跪在地上，抬起被包裹的剑状物，一道道术法不停撞击其上，令他的身躯节节后退。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"500201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0c/HeadIconSmall-500201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-500201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"500201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0c/HeadIconSmall-500201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-500201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0c/HeadIconSmall-500201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-500201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小队成员Ⅰ：</div><div>J先生，请你配合我们的调查……我们并不打算伤害你或你的同伴，如若你继续这样反抗下去，我们将不得已采用更为强硬的手段。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛蒂尔达：</div><div>难以置信，真是粗鲁的家伙……作为神秘学家，回击手段竟然全是贴身肉搏。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛蒂尔达：</div><div>而且还背着那样一把碍手碍脚的东西，真让人搞不懂。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛蒂尔达：</div><div>如果你乖乖配合，玛蒂尔达可以考虑考虑在调查报告中降低对你的风险评级……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她一边劝说着，一边找寻着之前透露出重塑之手情报的男人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>先前持着匕首的男人已不知所踪，那把匕首正安然无恙地躺在地上——没有火焰的痕迹。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>两名职员俯低了身子，一步步靠近这头气喘吁吁的猎物。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">J：</div><div>咳、咳……我得说……我也不想搞到这个地步，朋友们，我也希望我能乖乖求饶。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">J：</div><div>但，呸……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一口带着鲜血的唾沫被吐在地上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">J：</div><div>唉，可惜我从小到大，肚子挨了不少拳头，也还没学会举起双手——这项了不起的技巧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>手伸向怀中，正准备握住那把小巧又敏捷的博伊刀的刀柄——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">环状水星：</div><div>J……放下它，战争已经结束了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"500201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0c/HeadIconSmall-500201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-500201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"500201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0c/HeadIconSmall-500201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-500201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0c/HeadIconSmall-500201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-500201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小队成员Ⅰ：</div><div>？！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"500201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0c/HeadIconSmall-500201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-500201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"500201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0c/HeadIconSmall-500201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-500201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0c/HeadIconSmall-500201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-500201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小队成员Ⅰ：</div><div>这……这是曼德拉药草，是什么时候……？快遮住口鼻！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"500101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/86/HeadIconSmall-500101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-500101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"500101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/86/HeadIconSmall-500101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-500101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/86/HeadIconSmall-500101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-500101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小队成员Ⅱ：</div><div>屏住呼吸，离远一些，玛蒂尔……达，小姐……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>宛如中了麻醉的大象，他们腿脚一软，倒在了地上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛蒂尔达：</div><div>糟了……！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>局势转眼间变化。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她不禁后退了一步，却发现帐篷已紧紧闭上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"304118.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/80/HeadIconSmall-304118.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-304118.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"304118.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/80/HeadIconSmall-304118.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-304118.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/80/HeadIconSmall-304118.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-304118.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"140\" data-file-height=\"140\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛蒂尔达：</div><div>唔……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">J：</div><div>哼……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>被绑住的女孩与“绑匪”，像是两只争抢栗子的松鼠，不屑一顾地瞅着彼此。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"304118.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/80/HeadIconSmall-304118.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-304118.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"304118.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/80/HeadIconSmall-304118.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-304118.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/80/HeadIconSmall-304118.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-304118.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"140\" data-file-height=\"140\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛蒂尔达：</div><div>你们要知道，绑架基金会调查员与违抗调查，是非常严重的罪行……尤其是你们绑架的还是圣洛夫基金会最优秀的骨干成员——玛蒂尔达·布翁尼小姐！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">J：</div><div>什么优秀的骨干成员。一个没有经验的小家伙，刚好成了我们的漏网之鱼——这可不是什么光荣事迹。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他伸出手指，在女孩额头上“啪”地弹出了声儿。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>作为第一个拷问用刑，相当适用。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"304121.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/24/HeadIconSmall-304121.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-304121.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"304121.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/24/HeadIconSmall-304121.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-304121.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/24/HeadIconSmall-304121.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-304121.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"140\" data-file-height=\"140\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛蒂尔达：</div><div>喂！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"304121.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/24/HeadIconSmall-304121.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-304121.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"304121.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/24/HeadIconSmall-304121.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-304121.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/24/HeadIconSmall-304121.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-304121.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"140\" data-file-height=\"140\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛蒂尔达：</div><div>给我停下，你这个无礼的家伙！这是严重的冒犯！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">J：</div><div>告诉我，保利娜现在是不是还躲在基金会的某个小房间里，为了让我签署保密协议，才把你们派了过来？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"304118.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/80/HeadIconSmall-304118.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-304118.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"304118.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/80/HeadIconSmall-304118.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-304118.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/80/HeadIconSmall-304118.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-304118.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"140\" data-file-height=\"140\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛蒂尔达：</div><div>你到底在说什么胡话？……我们根本没有理由那样做，我们过来是为了带你和那个假人回去，你们已经严重违反了《圣洛夫基金会访客协议》的保密守则！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">先驱者：</div><div>J，我想我们得换个问法——玛蒂尔达小姐，你有什么证据能够证明J的妹妹已经殉职？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">先驱者：</div><div>你们先前所提供的照片与本人大相径庭，我们无法相信那些荒谬的证据。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"304121.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/24/HeadIconSmall-304121.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-304121.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"304121.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/24/HeadIconSmall-304121.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-304121.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/24/HeadIconSmall-304121.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-304121.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"140\" data-file-height=\"140\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛蒂尔达：</div><div>……！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"304120.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/84/HeadIconSmall-304120.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-304120.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"304120.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/84/HeadIconSmall-304120.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-304120.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/84/HeadIconSmall-304120.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-304120.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"140\" data-file-height=\"140\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛蒂尔达：</div><div>你是说，你们认识的保利娜也是——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"304120.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/84/HeadIconSmall-304120.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-304120.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"304120.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/84/HeadIconSmall-304120.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-304120.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/84/HeadIconSmall-304120.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-304120.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"140\" data-file-height=\"140\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛蒂尔达：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>眼前的人看似不羁，但眼神却格外关切。那是对至亲才会有的沉重的情绪。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"304118.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/80/HeadIconSmall-304118.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-304118.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"304118.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/80/HeadIconSmall-304118.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-304118.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/80/HeadIconSmall-304118.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-304118.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"140\" data-file-height=\"140\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛蒂尔达：</div><div>可恶，怎么说才好……总之，请相信，我们绝对没有任何要欺瞒你们的理由。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"304118.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/80/HeadIconSmall-304118.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-304118.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"304118.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/80/HeadIconSmall-304118.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-304118.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/80/HeadIconSmall-304118.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-304118.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"140\" data-file-height=\"140\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛蒂尔达：</div><div>倒不如说，这一切本就不该让你们知道……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她沉默了很久，似乎在思考当下要如何才表达得适当。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"304120.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/84/HeadIconSmall-304120.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-304120.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"304120.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/84/HeadIconSmall-304120.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-304120.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/84/HeadIconSmall-304120.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-304120.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"140\" data-file-height=\"140\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛蒂尔达：</div><div>我并不了解你们所认识的保利娜。但至少，曾经在基金会与我们共事过的保利娜，确实已经牺牲了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"304118.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/80/HeadIconSmall-304118.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-304118.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"304118.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/80/HeadIconSmall-304118.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-304118.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/80/HeadIconSmall-304118.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-304118.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"140\" data-file-height=\"140\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛蒂尔达：</div><div>至于照片与本人不符的问题，总部正在着手调查同类事件——但解开这个谜团，还需要一段漫长的时间。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"304118.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/80/HeadIconSmall-304118.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-304118.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"304118.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/80/HeadIconSmall-304118.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-304118.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/80/HeadIconSmall-304118.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-304118.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"140\" data-file-height=\"140\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛蒂尔达：</div><div>我的职级并不足以知晓全貌……而且因为保密的必要，玛蒂尔达不能透露任何消息给你们。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>那一双双盯着她的眼睛，没有任何波澜。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">J：</div><div>哈……我懂了。这个调查员也只是个被蒙在鼓里、一无所知的小家伙。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">J：</div><div>伙计，咱们还是留点力气去把他们打包送回圣洛夫基金会大门口吧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">J：</div><div>正好让过路人都看看基金会的风采！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他将椅子拎起来——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"304121.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/24/HeadIconSmall-304121.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-304121.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"304121.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/24/HeadIconSmall-304121.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-304121.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/24/HeadIconSmall-304121.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-304121.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"140\" data-file-height=\"140\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛蒂尔达：</div><div>啊，喂，等等，再等一等！！！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>“人质”陷入了思索。片刻，她不情不愿地抬起了头。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"304118.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/80/HeadIconSmall-304118.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-304118.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"304118.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/80/HeadIconSmall-304118.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-304118.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/80/HeadIconSmall-304118.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-304118.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"140\" data-file-height=\"140\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛蒂尔达：</div><div>那么，只要我证明了这位女士已经真的牺牲……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"304122.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f2/HeadIconSmall-304122.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-304122.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"304122.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f2/HeadIconSmall-304122.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-304122.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f2/HeadIconSmall-304122.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-304122.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"140\" data-file-height=\"140\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛蒂尔达：</div><div>你们就愿意乖乖跟我回去，对么？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>从口中轻飘飘地，她提出了一个交易。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>所有人都陷入了犹豫，沉默。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">J：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">先驱者：</div><div>……只要你的证据足以让我们信服。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"304118.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/80/HeadIconSmall-304118.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-304118.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"304118.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/80/HeadIconSmall-304118.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-304118.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/80/HeadIconSmall-304118.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-304118.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"140\" data-file-height=\"140\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛蒂尔达：</div><div>好吧，你们最好说话算话……我并不想打击你们，但如果你们非此不可……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>身上的绳索被解开了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她推开两人，抚平桌台上的黑色天鹅绒布，将水晶球放置于中央。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛蒂尔达：</div><div>我是水晶占卜师。你们应该很清楚这个能力代表着什么。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛蒂尔达：</div><div>请交给我一件象征保利娜女士身份的、她曾使用或拥有的物件，这个物件必须要与她的过往有着深刻的联结。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛蒂尔达：</div><div>我会循着它的气息，揭开迷雾，为你们找寻到她存在的痕迹或所在……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛蒂尔达：</div><div>但若等我揭开迷雾，发现在那之后空无一物……这通常便意味着只有一个可能。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛蒂尔达：</div><div>——而那时，你们就必须得跟我走了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛蒂尔达：</div><div>另外，据我所知，能量疗愈师通常拥有敏锐的灵性感知力，可以洞察神秘学家在占卜时能量的流动……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛蒂尔达：</div><div>这位女士，她应该可以在场证明我的占卜。你能做到吗……女士？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">环状水星：</div><div>我刚才已经见到了能量从你朋友们的手心，流向了术杖……于我而言，这不可能隐藏。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">先驱者：</div><div>J？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他把肩膀靠在柜子边，没有靠近，只是远远地答复。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">J：</div><div>保利娜肯定没想到她最信任的基金会帮手，如今将亲自揭穿她的谎言……我这个笨妹妹，这下该知道她哥哥对付她绰绰有余。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">J：</div><div>没问题，小家伙——拿去吧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一只软绒绒的玩具小熊，松散的绒毛已脱落了不少。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>那是她为这个家族留下的最后一件礼物，他当然保留着。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一切皆已就位，女孩抚平胸膛的躁动，缓和下呼吸。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛蒂尔达：</div><div>开始吧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>双手覆上水晶球，她紧闭双眼。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>缺少了月光与潮汐的加持，她的气息有些许紊乱。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>但没有关系，如今她只需要证明一个生命的存在……甚至不需要一个确切的所在。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛蒂尔达：</div><div>牵引物品的丝线，追寻这位所有者的迹象……请回应我的叩问。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>水晶球透过手指，散发出了微弱的光亮。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一团沉甸甸的迷雾升起，充溢水晶球。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309410.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/46/HeadIconSmall-309410.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309410.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309410.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/46/HeadIconSmall-309410.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309410.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/46/HeadIconSmall-309410.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309410.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">J：</div><div>……！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛蒂尔达：</div><div>褪去薄雾，褪去隐匿者的外壳，请显现她的实相——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛蒂尔达：</div><div>尽在我们眼中。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛蒂尔达：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>许久，涌动的迷雾已然褪去……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>女孩的双手离开了水晶球，眼睛瞥向别处，不再说一句话。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>摆放在一旁的小熊仍炯炯有神地盯着水晶球。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">J：</div><div>——嘿？小家伙，我们可还没有看见任何结果，你怎么突然撂摊子了？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">环状水星：</div><div>J……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">环状水星：</div><div>……这次占卜，正如她之前所说，已经宣告结束了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>而男人不以为然。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他知道这次他很冷静。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">J：</div><div>天呐，饶了我吧，你们这帮基金会的把戏还没用腻歪吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">J：</div><div>这次又是什么糊弄人的把戏？！你对这颗水晶球动了什么手脚……嗯？为了让她躲下去，你们有必要——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">先驱者：</div><div>J！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>假人的声音震耳欲聋，响彻回荡。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">先驱者：</div><div>……她已经不在了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">环状水星：</div><div>抱歉……J。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">J：</div><div>…………</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>没有惊诧或是愤怒，远处的J如此平静——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>连面容也没有丝毫变化。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>不是心如死灰，也绝非恍惚。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">先驱者：</div><div>你……还好吗，我的伙计？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">J：</div><div>不，我没事。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>嘴唇并不震颤，身体没有摇晃。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">J：</div><div>原来是这样……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他望向水晶球。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他的嘴唇几不可见地微张，想言语些什么，又合了回去。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_0_bg_xinjiyuanjishi1.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_0_bg_xinjiyuanjishi1\"><img alt=\"2_0_bg_xinjiyuanjishi1\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ec/Cg-2_0_bg_xinjiyuanjishi1.png/600px-Cg-2_0_bg_xinjiyuanjishi1.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ec/Cg-2_0_bg_xinjiyuanjishi1.png/900px-Cg-2_0_bg_xinjiyuanjishi1.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ec/Cg-2_0_bg_xinjiyuanjishi1.png/1200px-Cg-2_0_bg_xinjiyuanjishi1.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>那是什么？那是……什么？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他撇过头，望见远处喧闹的人群中，正有位年轻的女孩戴着花环舞蹈，悠悠地旋转——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>旋转。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>掌声此起彼伏，喜悦充盈着人们的脸。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他想他是时候该声泪俱下，或者向全世界挥空拳头，甚至砸烂那颗真相的水晶球。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>但他没有。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他站在那里，接受着这股前所未有的沉静。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>无人察觉，剔透的水晶球底部，出现了一道细微的裂痕。</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "FT-05"}}